{"step_index":289,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-05T10:31:43Z","input_tokens":2374,"cache_read_tokens":74673,"output_tokens":7137,"thinking":"Creating the necessary input files: `in.lammps`, `fracture_metadata.json`, and the python script and shell script for the simulation, placing them within the designated workspace directory for the calculation. This sets up the simulation environment for the desired calculation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# 2H-SiC {10-10} 8周期 (16層, 288原子) スラブ構造緩和計算入力スクリプト 【最適化収束条件版】\\n# ==============================================================================\\n# 【設計思想と収束閾値の物理的根拠 (AGENTS.md §9)】\\n# 1. DFT (Quantum ESPRESSO) の SCF 収束閾値 conv_thr = 1.0e-5 Ry において、\\n#    Hellmann-Feynman 力の数値ノイズ限界 (フロア) は ~0.0002 Ry/au (≈ 0.0051 eV/Å)。\\n# 2. 本設定では、全規模スラブ共通の恒久標準である\\n#      minimize 1.0e-6 1.0e-2 100 150\\n#    を採用し、ftol = 1.0e-2 eV/Å と etol = 1.0e-6 の二重基準で自然収束させる。\\n# 3. 切断面は自然へき開面 (粗結合面 dz ≈ 1.7758 Å 切断、両端密結合 dz ≈ 0.8881 Å 保持)、\\n#    真空層厚さは上下各 5.0 Å (合計 10.0 Å)。\\n# ==============================================================================\\n\\nunits metal\\nboundary p p p\\natom_style atomic\\natom_modify map yes\\n\\n# 1. 構造ファイルの読み込み (288原子 8周期 16層 自然へき開面スラブ, 真空層 5.0 Å)\\nread_data slab_10-10_288atoms_vac5A.data\\n\\n# 原子質量 (Type 1: C, Type 2: Si - ASEの英名昇順ソートと完全一致, AGENTS.md §2)\\nmass 1 12.011\\nmass 2 28.085\\n\\n# 2. MDI 通信設定 (Quantum ESPRESSO を QM エンジンとして連成)\\nfix 1 all mdi/qm elements C Si\\n\\n# 3. 出力設定 (リアルタイム監視のため flush yes を有効化)\\nthermo 1\\nthermo_modify flush yes\\ndump 1 all custom 1 dump.lammpstrj id type x y z\\ndump_modify 1 append yes flush yes\\n\\n# 4. 表面構造緩和 (minimize: AGENTS.md §9 恒久標準)\\n# 構文: minimize etol ftol maxiter maxeval\\n# - etol: 1.0e-6 (相対エネルギー差 <= 10^-6 で収束)\\n# - ftol: 1.0e-2 eV/Å (最大作用力 <= 0.01 eV/Å で収束、DFTノイズ限界直上)\\n# - maxiter: 100 (最大CG反復ステップ数)\\n# - maxeval: 150 (最大力評価回数)\\nminimize 1.0e-6 1.0e-2 100 150\\n\\nundump 1\\nwrite_data slab_10-10_288\n<truncated 27 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup/calc_2H-SiC_10-10_8periods_vac5A_natural_cleavage/in.lammps\""}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"{\\n    \\\"cleavage_plane\\\": \\\"10-10\\\",\\n    \\\"cleavage_type\\\": \\\"natural_cleavage_sparse_bond\\\",\\n    \\\"n_periods\\\": 8,\\n    \\\"n_layers\\\": 16,\\n    \\\"natoms\\\": 288,\\n    \\\"vacuum_thickness_angstrom\\\": 5.0,\\n    \\\"supercell_xy\\\": [\\n        3,\\n        3\\n    ],\\n    \\\"cell_slab\\\": [\\n        9.228,\\n        15.144,\\n        29.53540130124298\\n    ],\\n    \\\"cell_bulk\\\": [\\n        9.228,\\n        15.144,\\n        21.311153136327466\\n    ],\\n    \\\"area_A_angstrom2\\\": 139.748832,\\n    \\\"total_area_2A_angstrom2\\\": 279.497664,\\n    \\\"unit_conversion_eV_A2_to_J_m2\\\": 16.021766,\\n    \\\"effective_denominator\\\": 17.44487243166577,\\n    \\\"true_bulk_scf_energy_Ry\\\": -9387.69989164,\\n    \\\"true_bulk_scf_energy_eV\\\": -127726.1628,\\n    \\\"reference_rauls_relaxed_J_m2\\\": 2.27,\\n    \\\"reference_rauls_unrelaxed_J_m2\\\": 2.44,\\n    \\\"reference_rauls_dimer_J_m2\\\": 3.03,\\n    \\\"slab_data_file\\\": \\\"slab_10-10_288atoms_vac5A.data\\\",\\n    \\\"bulk_data_file\\\": \\\"bulk_10-10_288atoms_true_bulk.data\\\"\\n}\\n\"","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup/calc_2H-SiC_10-10_8periods_vac5A_natural_cleavage/fracture_metadata.json\""}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n==============================================================================\\nQuantum ESPRESSO + MDI 連成エンジン (RTX 5080 16GB + Core Ultra 9 285K 24コア最適化版)\\n==============================================================================\\n・2H-SiC {10-10} 8周期 (16層, 288原子) 真空層 5.0 Å スラブ構造緩和用\\n・Core Ultra 9 285K (24コア / 64GB RAM) + RTX 5080 (16GB VRAM) 環境向け\\n・ASE + MDI DummyMPI 適用 (AGENTS.md §3)\\n・Type 1 = C (12.011), Type 2 = Si (28.085) 厳格一致 (AGENTS.md §2)\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport sys\\nimport os\\nimport glob\\nimport shutil\\nimport subprocess\\nimport time\\nimport numpy as np\\nimport mdi\\nfrom ase import Atoms\\nfrom ase.calculators.espresso import Espresso, EspressoProfile\\nimport ase.parallel\\n\\n# Rule 3: ASE + MDI の DummyMPI 必須化 (SIGABRT 防止)\\nase.parallel.world = ase.parallel.DummyMPI()\\n\\nELEMENTS = [\\n    'H' , 'He', 'Li', 'Be', 'B' , 'C' , 'N' , 'O' , 'F' , 'Ne',\\n    'Na', 'Mg', 'Al', 'Si', 'P' , 'S' , 'Cl', 'Ar', 'K' , 'Ca',\\n    'Sc', 'Ti', 'V' , 'Cr', 'Mn', 'Fe', 'Co', 'Ni', 'Cu', 'Zn',\\n    'Ga', 'Ge', 'As', 'Se', 'Br', 'Kr', 'Rb', 'Sr', 'Y' , 'Zr',\\n    'Nb', 'Mo', 'Tc', 'Ru', 'Rh', 'Pd', 'Ag', 'Cd', 'In', 'Sn',\\n    'Sb', 'Te', 'I' , 'Xe', 'Cs', 'Ba', 'La', 'Ce', 'Pr', 'Nd',\\n    'Pm', 'Sm', 'Eu', 'Gd', 'Tb', 'Dy', 'Ho', 'Er', 'Tm', 'Yb',\\n    'Lu', 'Hf', 'Ta', 'W' , 'Re', 'Os', 'Ir', 'Pt', 'Au', 'Hg',\\n    'Tl', 'Pb', 'Bi', 'Po', 'At', 'Rn', 'Fr', 'Ra', 'Ac', 'Th',\\n    'Pa', 'U' , 'Np', 'Pu', 'Am', 'Cm', 'Bk', 'Cf', 'Es', 'Fm',\\n    'Md', 'No', 'Lr', 'Rf', 'Db', 'Sg', 'Bh', 'Hs', 'Mt', 'Ds',\\n    'Rg', 'Cn', 'Nh', 'Fl', 'Mc', 'Lv', 'Ts', 'Og',\\n]\\natomic_number_to_symbol = {i + 1: symbol for i, symbol in enumerate(ELEMENTS)}\\n# Rule 2: Type 1 = C (12.011), Type 2 = Si (28.085)\\ntype_to_symbol = {1: 'C', 2: 'Si'}\\n\\nexitflag = False\\nqm_natoms = 0\\nqm_elements = None\\nqm_coords = None\\nbox = np.zeros(9, dtype=np.float64)\\nflag_box = False\\n\\nqm_pe = 0.0\\nqm_forces = None\\nlast_eval\n<truncated 13590 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup/calc_2H-SiC_10-10_8periods_vac5A_natural_cleavage/qe_mdi_engine_rtx5080.py\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
